<title>UK: Standard economist moving to ING-Baring - spokesman.</title>
<headline>Standard economist moving to ING-Baring - spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Chartered Bank Plc Chief Economist Christopher Tinker is to leave the company at the end of August to work for ING Barings, a Standard spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said Tinker, who has spent three-and-a-half years at Standard in London, is leaving the firm on amicable terms and will take up the post of Chief Economist and Head of Debt Research with ING-Barings in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8968</p>
</text>
